mame2003-xtreme: declare mame2003_video_get_geometry before use

video.c defines it, but no header declares it and libretro.c calls it from
retro_get_system_av_info().  gcc 14 rejects the implicit declaration:

  src/libretro/libretro.c:432:3: error: implicit declaration of function
                                 'mame2003_video_get_geometry'

Declare it next to the other extern declarations in that file, matching the
definition at src/libretro/video.c:48.

Build-enablement only -- no behaviour change.

--- a/src/libretro/libretro.c
+++ b/src/libretro/libretro.c
@@ -188,6 +188,9 @@
 
 //
 
+/* Defined in src/libretro/video.c; no header declares it. */
+extern void mame2003_video_get_geometry(struct retro_game_geometry *geom);
+
 extern const struct KeyboardInfo retroKeys[];
 extern int retroKeyState[512];
 extern int retroJsState[72];
